                <mxCell id="251" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Why do we need both package.json and lockfile&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="330" width="376.25" x="-613" y="680" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="60" x="100" y="250" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="252" parent="251" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 0, 102));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;package.json says what you &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;&quot;&gt;want&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;. The lockfile says what you actually &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;&quot;&gt;got&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="376.25" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="256" parent="251" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="Problem with package.json: -&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Becuase the package.json stores the package version in increasing way, so this will install the different packages for different team members over the specific period of time leading inconsistency and various bugs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="100" width="376.25" y="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="254" parent="251" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Lockfile stores these, so that in production these can be verified: -&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(250, 250, 250), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Exact version&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(250, 250, 250), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; of every package in the entire tree (direct + transitive)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px solid; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; text-rendering: geometricprecision;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(250, 250, 250), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Integrity hash&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(250, 250, 250), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; — a cryptographic fingerprint of the exact bytes downloaded. If a registry is compromised and someone swaps the tarball, install fails. Security package.json can&#39;t provide.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="150" width="376.25" y="180" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="72" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffcd28;gradientColor=#ffa500;strokeColor=#d79b00;" value="npm package Installing and execution architecture" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="160" width="352.5" x="273.75" y="-70" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="60" x="600" y="10" as="alternateBounds"/>
