                    <mxGeometry height="50" width="352.5" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="239" parent="72" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2. When we run this cmd &quot;npm run&quot;, it &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 0, 204));&quot;&gt;only installs the dependencies&lt;/span&gt; from package.json, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;never its devDependenc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;ies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;But we can also explicitly install the devDevpendencies too&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
