                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="234" parent="233" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(240, 246, 252); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(13, 17, 23);&quot;&gt;One caveat: some packages may still end up nested inside a workspace&#39;s own node_modules if version conflicts or package-resolution rules require it. That is normal too.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="383.75" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fWgTr4KS03wdthizs9iE-272" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;fillColor=#1ba1e2;strokeColor=#006EAF;fontColor=#ffffff;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;npm problems&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="260" width="383.75" x="-878.12" y="-390" as="geometry">
                        <mxRectangle height="30" width="60" x="690" y="-430" as="alternateBounds"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fWgTr4KS03wdthizs9iE-273" parent="fWgTr4KS03wdthizs9iE-272" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="1. Package duplication: - Before npm v3, dependencies were &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;installed exactly according to the dependency grap&lt;/span&gt;h, which makes deeply nested node_moduels&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Duplicaiton problem&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A single folder have tens of thousands of files would make the filesystem lookups slower, also window often hit max_path limit for nested folders&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="140" width="383.75" y="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="fWgTr4KS03wdthizs9iE-274" parent="fWgTr4KS03wdthizs9iE-272" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" value="2. Phantom dependency: - Starting npm v3 (flattened), npm tried to hoist as many dependencies to the top level node_modules folder&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;This &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;solves the deeply nesting problem,&lt;/span&gt; but &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 153, 153));&quot;&gt;introduced phantom dependency problem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="90" width="383.75" y="170" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
